{"title":"IAFOR Global Fellowship Programme Series: Creative Research Conference at the University of Cambridge","link":"https://iafor.org/iafor-global-fellowship-programme-series-creative-research-conference-at-the-university-of-cambridge/","date":1732759243000,"content":"<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Global-Fellowship-Creative-Research-Conference-0-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"IAFOR Global Fellowship Programme Series: Creative Research Conference at the University of Cambridge\" srcset=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Global-Fellowship-Creative-Research-Conference-0-150x150.jpg 150w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Global-Fellowship-Creative-Research-Conference-0-600x600.jpg 600w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Global-Fellowship-Creative-Research-Conference-0-100x100.jpg 100w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Global-Fellowship-Creative-Research-Conference-0-50x50.jpg 50w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Global-Fellowship-Creative-Research-Conference-0-300x300.jpg 300w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Global-Fellowship-Creative-Research-Conference-0-32x32.jpg 32w\" />Dr Sheng-Hsiang Lance Peng, a current IAFOR Global Fellow, presented a research methodology workshop on ‘hauntology’ at the first annual Cambridge Creative Research Conference (CCRC) in collaboration with the University of Cambridge, United Kingdom; held online via Zoom on October 26, 2024. The event offered a wide range of participatory workshops focused on creative research <a href=\"https://iafor.org/iafor-global-fellowship-programme-series-creative-research-conference-at-the-university-of-cambridge/\">...</a>\n<p><a href=\"https://iafor.org/iafor-global-fellowship-programme-series-creative-research-conference-at-the-university-of-cambridge/\">Source</a></p>","author":"IAFOR","siteTitle":"The International Academic Forum (IAFOR)","siteHash":"db6175d8277e1d8dd86d5cc607b1dd9335c